      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAKO MERV (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (23.13) at Dubbo behind Armatree Pesto in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal. PHOENIX VIOLET (1) comes here off a placing in quick time (22.75) over 400m at Wagga when beaten 0.8 lengths in a Grade 5. Smart time latest and looks a key chance on that form. WILD ANGELA (3) finds it hard to break through. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing second (18.95) at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Expected to feature again. ARKA AIR (7) was out of placings last time (20.17) at Goulburn in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 6 lengths. Has already won four times from this draw.",
